  <p id="c-taipingyulan-396-jin076-yunzhi:name" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">《晋中興書》曰：<persName id="c-taipingyulan-396-jin076-yunzhi:name:m0008" ref="a04_d8f_416">王允之</persName>字<persName id="c-taipingyulan-396-jin076-yunzhi:name:m0012" ref="a04_d8f_416">淵猷</persName>，年在總角，從伯<persName id="c-taipingyulan-396-jin076-yunzhi:name:m0022" ref="39o_b6y_n74">敦</persName>知之，謂爲似己，入則共寢。</p>
